    liable for any indirect, incidental or consequential damages arising from your use of the site
    or reliance on its content.
  </p>

  <h2>Privacy</h2>
  <p>
    Your use of the site is also governed by our <a href={LEGAL_LINKS.privacy}>Privacy Policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
  <p>
